       Although there are already many indicator systems to assess education systems, there is
  no system particularly built for higher education system. Besides, in line with Target 4.3 of
  Sustainable Development Goal 4 to “by 2030, ensure equal access for all women and men to




                                      型
  affordable and quality technical, vocational and tertiary education, including university,”
  UNESCO encourages a healthy and sustainable higher education system with equitable access




                                     模
  to quality higher education and enhanced mobility and accountability. Therefore, it is necessary
  to build a model to measure and assess the health of a system of higher education and give
  policy suggestions accordingly.




